note Compose after cache/digest.om and blackwell/identity.om, with an om2 prefix.
note The native public ABI uses long/ulong; the canonical int result is converted without new policy.
fn bw_id_native data view uchar 256 n ulong dst edit uchar 32 to long
ret long bw_identity data n dst
end
